# .gitignore

```gitignore
# kind clusters / kind configs
*.kind
kind-*.yaml

# helm / manifests artifacts
*.yaml.bak
*.tpl
*.dump.yaml

# Cilium dumps
cilium-dump-*.tar.gz

# logs
*.log

# editors
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# local tooling state
artifacts/
tmp/

# secrets (never commit)
*.secrets.yaml
.env
```

---

## env — global tooling pin

```toml
# ~/.config/mise/config.toml
[tools]
cilium-cli = "latest"
kind       = "latest"
kubectl    = "latest"
docker     = "latest"
```

---

## Pre-commit (optional)

```yaml
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/pre-commit/pre-commit-hooks
    rev: v4.6.0
    hooks:
      - id: trailing-whitespace
      - id: end-of-file-fixer
      - id: check-yaml
      - id: check-added-large-files
```
